  "title": "Peak TRC: Regex match in raw mode",
  "description": "According to the GLib documentation for g_regex_match,\n\n\"Unless G_REGEX_RAW is specified in the options, string must be valid\nUTF-8.\"\n\nhttps://docs.gtk.org/glib/method.Regex.match.html\n\nThe PEAK CAN TRC file format uses only ASCII bytes for its meaningful\ninformation, so match with G_REGEX_RAW.\n\nhttps://www.peak-system.com/produktcd/Pdf/English/PEAK_CAN_TRC_File_Format.pdf\n\nAlso fix a bad variable name in the debug code (which isn't compiled by\ndefault).\n\nFix #20546",
